            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
  - answerText: "Nh\u1EB7t l\xEAn n\u1EBFu \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n an to\xE0n v\xE0
      x\u1EED l\xFD \u0111\xFAng n\u01A1i/quy \u0111\u1ECBnh"
    score: 100
    feedbackText: "M\u1ED9t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng nh\u1ECF c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      tham quan c\u0169ng g\xF3p ph\u1EA7n gi\u1EA3m t\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng l\xEAn
